    {
      "id": "i1",
      "content": "To start, you need to note the vendor number on the Invoice entry form."
    },
    {
      "id": "i2",
      "content": "If you choose to \"Sort Invoice by vendor\", you should proceed with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i3",
      "content": "\"Sort Invoice by vendor\""
    },
    {
      "id": "i4",
      "content": "you should proceed with the process"
    },
    {
      "id": "i5",
      "content": "However, if you decide to \"Sort invoice by invoice amount\", you should also continue with the process."
    },
    {
      "id": "i6",
      "content": "\"Sort invoice by invoice amount\""
    },
    {
      "id": "i7",
      "content": "you should also continue with the process"
    },
    {
      "id": "i8",
      "content": "It takes approximately 20 minutes for every 100 invoices, and once you have entered the invoice data, make sure to tick \"invoice entered\" on the invoice entry form."
    },
    {
      "id": "i9",
      "content": "Once you have placed the invoice batch in the Urgent Outbox, it will be collected every hour."
    },
    {
      "id": "i10",
      "content": "until the end of the overall process"
    }
